   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Meanwhile, I am sending Lieutenant Alverold on an exploratory mission around the continent of Kalimdor. His forces are to complete their mission and then join our forces at Tiragarde Keep.\r\n\r\nIt is anticipated that Lieutenant Alverold's mission will last quite some time. The new land seems vast and dangerous. But should any misfortune befall myself or Benedict, Alverold's troops will retake the Keep.\r\n\r\nWe will send wave after wave until that stronghold is ours!\r\n\r\n--Admiral Proudmoore",
   "time": 1791565860,
   "title": "Admiral Proudmoore's Orders",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Durotar"
  },
  "9c463c84": {
   "build": "70291",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1411,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Official Orders For The Kul Tiras Fleet\r\n\r\nI, Admiral Proudmoore, shall lead the first landing upon the shores of Kalimdor.\r\n\r\nLieutenant Benedict will be second in command in my absence. All domestic Kul Tiras military matters will be handled by him. If I do not send word from Tiragarde Keep within 12 months time, Lieutenant Benedict will lead the second wave to hold the location.",
   "time": 1791565858,
   "title": "Admiral Proudmoore's Orders",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Durotar"
  }
 },
